{"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.065696937655029097,"h":0.016458982869729022,"w":0.12840997060139975,"y":0.037403365701660918},{"c":1,"w":0.33814432779947917,"h":0.013211978860833806,"t":"OFFICIAL: Now, are you having a band?","x":0.068041238095105802,"y":0.087199060476052637},{"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.068023220971789242,"y":0.10458946351131948,"h":0.0088443285706318875,"w":0.059829845428466796,"c":1},{"h":0.016431506073481872,"t":"Yes.","x":0.14890448054950095,"y":0.10193916662508551,"c":1,"w":0.046847813924153631},{"y":0.11918604644458264,"t":"oFFIcIAL: Well, they'Il have a lot of equipment, so rather than using the front door they should","c":1,"w":0.7896907043457031,"h":0.013227341809275539,"x":0.070103101345075636},{"y":0.13273482873379405,"h":0.020140750367572791,"t":"park their van round the back and use the stage door there. You can open that","w":0.66631271362304689,"c":1,"x":0.15447712152747517},{"x":0.15670102489302062,"w":0.39793815612792971,"c":1,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.15116279062804772,"t":"from inside but don't forget to lock it at the end."},{"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"x":0.068041236416442524,"c":1,"w":0.059793815612792983,"y":0.17005813966136762},{"c":1,"y":0.1860465117575355,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.068041237760850817,"w":0.068041235605875647,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"c":1,"w":0.030927832921346043,"y":0.16715116259476781,"t":"OK","x":0.1546391763846878,"h":0.013081395479069058},{"x":0.15051546040794675,"h":0.014534883616744709,"w":0.70103093465169275,"y":0.18313953493322743,"c":1,"t":"And talking of bands, I'm sure I don't need to tell you this, but you must make sure"},{"t":"that no one fiddles about with the black box by the fire door - that's a system that","x":0.15463918041180402,"y":0.19906048163106549,"w":0.6907216389973958,"h":0.013211978860833806,"c":1},{"t":"cuts in when the volume reaches a certain level. It's a legal requirement.","x":0.15459415934898621,"h":0.014826706837571701,"y":0.21380253491601142,"w":0.61454650878906247,"c":1},{"x":0.067929882228759217,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.23361562751275289,"w":0.060016523996988938,"h":0.0095129309859754985,"c":1},{"x":0.15670103107919714,"w":0.68453608194986981,"c":1,"y":0.23106283010175654,"t":"Sure. Anyway, we want people to be able to talk to one another so we don't want","h":0.014679976512037562},{"w":0.68865976969401044,"x":0.15463918721081485,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"anything too loud. Oh, that reminds me, well be having speeches - are there any","y":0.24854651167741337,"c":1},{"w":0.20040826161702474,"x":0.1565016716938275,"h":0.0137547242662448,"t":"microphones available?","y":0.26297639771163017,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.068216457366943373,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.067953626588329541,"y":0.28162383157389881,"h":0.0094267553395546155},{"y":0.28038755142945648,"w":0.65979380289713552,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"x":0.15257732525081641,"t":"Yeah. Just let the caretaker know, hel get those for you. Right, now when the"},{"x":0.15463918239239358,"h":0.014534883616744931,"w":0.68247421264648434,"c":1,"y":0.2950581395809202,"t":"event is over we do ask that the premises are left in good condition. So there's a"},{"t":"locked cupboard and you'll be informed of the code you need to open that. It's got","h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.31238990022610236,"w":0.69690719604492191,"x":0.15051547403939472,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.52183537801106761,"x":0.15454722595942344,"y":0.32659557001936235,"h":0.016621941898545378,"t":"all the cleaning equipment, brushes and detergent and so on."},{"w":0.06397001266479492,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"x":0.06389128221335301,"h":0.010339257581333472,"y":0.34584781305133538},{"t":"Right. So what do we need to do after everyone's gone? Sweep the floors I","y":0.34145625343045971,"c":1,"x":0.15257733063430245,"h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.64329895019531247},{"w":0.087260869344075537,"x":0.15224505716907505,"t":"suppose!","c":1,"y":0.36067447804366493,"h":0.014075816272639208},{"w":0.06829224904378256,"y":0.37772798574422439,"c":1,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.065838114241429324,"h":0.0097010417048957187},{"y":0.37639459749287152,"w":0.65773193359374993,"x":0.15257733206878016,"t":"Wel, actually they have to be washed, not just swept. Then youll be provided","h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.69896906534830738,"t":"with black plastic bags, so all the rubbish must be collected up and left outside the","x":0.15051546722345249,"y":0.39244186063170772,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"y":0.40796074273891847,"h":0.013441551732653045,"t":"door.","x":0.15181916726569736,"c":1,"w":0.044870011011759442},{"x":0.06577356404562687,"w":0.062267303466796875,"y":0.42521044028434385,"h":0.011497723797245452,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1},{"w":0.70124359130859371,"t":"Of course. We'll make sure everything's left tidy. Oh, and I forgot to ask, Lpresume","x":0.15247207776482885,"c":1,"y":0.42161317926913899,"h":0.019883779099039489},{"t":"we can have decorations in the room?","w":0.32577318827311197,"x":0.15257732331169147,"c":1,"y":0.44039929531624389,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.065979382556107358,"w":0.065979379018147793,"c":1,"y":0.45930232571058427,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"y":0.45625366972894521,"w":0.39175257364908855,"h":0.014679976512037674,"x":0.15257732129702484,"c":1,"t":"Yes, but you must take them down arterwards."},{"h":0.0089476793146945344,"y":0.47517732311737237,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.06594646308825515,"w":0.059859650929768873},{"y":0.47289138154761035,"c":1,"x":0.15429543151678557,"t":"Sure.","w":0.048224080403645814,"h":0.011993802440775525},{"t":"OFFICIAL: And the chairs and tables should be stacked up neatly at the back of the room","y":0.48825601852757039,"c":1,"x":0.065979373738870403,"h":0.013211978860833806,"w":0.74845362345377597},{"c":1,"x":0.065979380742668042,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.059793815612792983,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.50726744198757023},{"x":0.15051546372164951,"c":1,"t":"I'Il make sure l've got a few people to help me.","y":0.50436046504462251,"w":0.40000000000000002,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"t":"SECTION 2","c":1,"w":0.16288659413655598,"x":0.065979383241000375,"y":0.55666470956144398,"h":0.014679976512037674},{"x":0.063917520356793794,"c":1,"w":0.70927836100260422,"t":"Welcome to the Fiddy Working Heritage Farm. This open-air museum gives you the","h":0.014679976512037674,"y":0.58573106270952835},{"x":0.06391752252970434,"t":"experience of agriculture and rural life in the English countryside at the end of the nineteenth","w":0.78556701660156247,"c":1,"y":0.60174418609657998,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"h":0.014680829946951302,"c":1,"w":0.75670104980468755,"y":0.61773255818939155,"t":"century. So you'll see a typical farm of that period, and like me, all the staff are dressed in","x":0.065979371911296117},{"h":0.011761050467902767,"t":"clothes of that time.","y":0.63358778621837863,"c":1,"x":0.065979382679095172,"w":0.16494845072428385},{"x":0.061796635534996272,"w":0.78775126139322915,"h":0.018560219147033208,"c":1,"t":"I must give you some advice and safety tips before we go any further. As it's a working farm,","y":0.65588350594475364},{"c":1,"t":"please don't frighten or injure the animals. We have a lot here, and many of them are breeds","w":0.78771993001302076,"x":0.061808519201139708,"y":0.67274802121620081,"h":0.017162592356441575},{"y":0.68756526088026226,"h":0.017567473863477456,"c":1,"t":"that are now quite rare.","x":0.061493922327245605,"w":0.20282267252604169},{"x":0.061801178986357473,"h":0.016978971690762013,"c":1,"y":0.71269814614123783,"w":0.78774800618489582,"t":"And do stay at a safe distance from the tools: some of them have sharp points which can be"},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"t":"pretty dangerous, so please don't touch them. We don't want any accidents, do we?","w":0.71340204874674473,"y":0.72959483288915539,"x":0.061855676743747763},{"x":0.061855675918119746,"c":1,"t":"The ground is very uneven, and you might slip if you're wearing sandals so I'm glad to see.","w":0.77525772094726553,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.75278919551461143},{"y":0.77034883725382486,"h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1,"w":0.53195877075195308,"t":"you're all wearing shoes - we always advise people to do that.","x":0.061855666239143688},{"c":1,"t":"Now, children of all ages are very welcome here, and usually even very young children love","x":0.061855668685131399,"h":0.015988371754420583,"w":0.77731959025065112,"y":0.79505813970198269},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.061855665514627088,"w":0.56288660685221359,"y":0.81092190233918726,"c":1,"t":"the ducks and lambs, so do bring them along next time you come."},{"y":0.83262630235257251,"t":"Idon't think any of you have brought dogs with you, but in case you have, I'm afraid they'Il","w":0.77126190185546872,"h":0.01768256325758133,"x":0.061798612231082281,"c":1},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"have to stay in the car park, unless they're guide dogs. I'm sure you'll understand that they","w":0.76907216389973965,"y":0.85026423955999264,"c":1,"x":0.061855670630429432},{"c":1,"x":0.063917525886355922,"t":"could cause a lot of problems on a farm.","w":0.34226804097493491,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.86627906969284663},{"x":0.05773195948482903,"y":0.947674418503198,"w":0.039175256093343096,"t":"104","h":0.013081395479069058,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.02473471658900428,"y":0.95224425374898214,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35210298783219535,"w":0.29367724100748699},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"Q7","x":0.87216494828497082,"w":0.028865979512532558,"y":0.1337209301129364},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"x":0.87010309260693741,"t":"Q8","w":0.028865979512532558,"y":0.29651162779154783},{"t":"Q9","c":1,"w":0.028865979512532558,"x":0.87010309261486785,"y":0.37645348825247127,"h":0.013081395479069058},{"c":1,"w":0.039175256093343047,"y":0.45639534873361876,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"Q10","x":0.87010309349972015},{"w":0.037113402684529673,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"t":"Q11","x":0.86804123670503652,"y":0.67441860454757219},{"w":0.041237112681070887,"c":1,"x":0.86804123736474048,"y":0.71366279070701755,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"Q12"},{"c":1,"t":"Q13","x":0.87010309349399284,"y":0.7543604650148259,"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"y":0.8343023254778047,"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"Q14","x":0.86804123782961706,"w":0.039175256093343158,"c":1}],"h":3406,"w":2400}